{"step_index":1901,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:46:45Z","thinking":"The initial extraction proved clean; now, revising the script to utilize this precise `<li>` data for all 192 companies. I'll modify the extraction to capture key financial and operational details including revenue, employee count, founding date, and business type for each company. The goal is to create a structured dataset with the extracted information.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Inspect if Saramin mentions the fiscal year for revenue","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"const https = require('https');\n\nhttps.get('https://www.saramin.co.kr/zf_user/company-info/view?csn=ZjQvcWk4cUVOYW9KWnh3b1AxWUNNZz09', {\n  headers: {\n    'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',\n    'Accept-Language': 'ko-KR,ko;q=0.9'\n  }\n}, res => {\n  let d = '';\n  res.on('data', c => d += c);\n  res.on('end', () => {\n    // search for year next to 매출액\n    const idx = d.indexOf('매출액');\n    if (idx !== -1) {\n      console.log('Surrounding HTML around 매출액 (first):');\n      console.log(d.substring(Math.max(0, idx - 200), idx + 200));\n    }\n  });\n});\n","Description":"Check fiscal year near revenue in Saramin","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2/scratch/check_rev_year.js","toolAction":"Checking revenue fiscal year","toolSummary":"Check revenue fiscal year"}}]}
