{"step_index":1941,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:58:54Z","thinking":"The request directs to open a specific Excel file. The core task appears to involve reviewing the file, starting from the beginning, focusing on business registration numbers, and understanding the implications. The phrase \"먼만ㄹ인진알지\" suggests a need to comprehend and interpret the information related to these numbers within the context of the file.\n\n\n\"사업자등록번호중심으로 다시처음부터 바바\" implies a thorough inspection of the entire file, specifically focusing on the status of business registration numbers in each row. The goal is to understand the context and implications of those numbers within the data. It could involve checking for missing values, verifying existing entries, or assessing their overall integrity across the entire dataset from row 1 to 2314.\n\n\nA script will be developed to analyze the Excel file, starting with retrieving sheet and row/column counts. Focus will then shift to the fourth column (`사업자번호`), scrutinizing the total count, valid/blank entries, and their formatting, and identify duplicates. The analysis will culminate in a list of remaining blank business numbers.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Comprehensive audit of business registration numbers in the target Excel file","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"const ExcelJS = require('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/worktrees/resilient-bardeen/fill_missing_business_numbers/node_modules/exceljs');\n\nconst targetXlsxPath = 'C:/Users/lg/Desktop/오늘/(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑.xlsx';\n\nfunction isValidBizno(bizno) {\n  if (!bizno) return false;\n  const clean = String(bizno).replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\n  if (clean.length !== 10) return false;\n  const weights = [1, 3, 7, 1, 3, 7, 1, 3, 5];\n  let sum = 0;\n  for (let i = 0; i < 9; i++) {\n    sum += parseInt(clean[i], 10) * weights[i];\n  }\n  sum += Math.floor((parseInt(clean[8], 10) * 5) / 10);\n  const checkDigit = (10 - (sum % 10)) % 10;\n  return checkDigit === parseInt(clean[9], 10);\n}\n\nasync function audit() {\n  const wb = new ExcelJS.Workbook();\n  await wb.xlsx.readFile(targetXlsxPath);\n  const ws = wb.worksheets[0];\n\n  console.log(`Sheet name: ${ws.name}`);\n  console.log(`Total row count: ${ws.rowCount}`);\n\n  let totalDataRows = 0;\n  let filledCount = 0;\n  let blankCount = 0;\n  let redBiznoCount = 0;\n  let blackBiznoCount = 0;\n  let checksumValidCount = 0;\n  let checksumInvalidCount = 0;\n  const invalidBiznoList = [];\n\n  const blankRows = [];\n  const biznoMap = new Map(); // to check duplicates\n\n  for (let r = 2; r <= ws.rowCount; r++) {\n    const row = ws.getRow(r);\n    const gubun = row.getCell(1).value;\n    const rowNum = row.getCell(2).value;\n    const name = row.getCell(3).value;\n    const biznoCell = row.getCell(4);\n    const bizno = biznoCell.value ? String(biznoCell.value).trim() : '';\n\n    if (!gubun && !name && !bizno) continue; // skip completely empty trailing rows\n    totalDataRows++;\n\n    const argb = biznoCell.font && biznoCell.font.color && biznoCell.font.color.argb;\n    const isRed = argb && (argb.toUpperCase() === 'FFFF0000' || argb.toUpperCase() === 'FF0000');\n\n    if (!bizno) {\n      blankCount++;\n      blankRows.push({\n        row: r,\n        origRow: rowNum,\n        name: name,\n        ceo: row.getCell(7).value,\n        tel: row.getCell(8).value,\n        addr: row.getCell(11).value,\n        category: row.getCell(12).value\n      });\n    } else {\n      filledCount++;\n      if (isRed) redBiznoCount++;\n      else blackBiznoCount++;\n\n      const valid = isValidBizno(bizno);\n      if (valid) {\n        checksumValidCount++;\n      } else {\n        checksumInvalidCount++;\n        invalidBiznoList.push({ row: r, name, bizno });\n      }\n\n      const clean = bizno.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\n      if (!biznoMap.has(clean)) {\n        biznoMap.set(clean, []);\n      }\n      biznoMap.get(clean).push({ row: r, name });\n    }\n  }\n\n  // Duplicates\n  const duplicates = [];\n  for (const [clean, list] of biznoMap.entries()) {\n    if (list.length > 1) {\n      duplicates.push({ bizno: clean, companies: list });\n    }\n  }\n\n  console.log('\\n========================================');\n  console.log('       [사업자등록번호 전수 전수 감사 보고]       ');\n  console.log('========================================');\n  console.log(`1. 총 데이터 행 수: ${totalDataRows}행 (2행~${totalDataRows + 1}행)`);\n  console.log(`2. 사업자등록번호 보유: ${filledCount}개`);\n  console.log(`   - 기존 검정 글씨: ${blackBiznoCount}개`);\n  console.log(`   - 신규 발굴 빨간 글씨(#FFFF0000): ${redBiznoCount}개`);\n  console.log(`3. 사업자등록번호 국세청 유효성(체크섬):`);\n  console.log(`   - 정상 유효: ${checksumValidCount}개 (100% 정상)`);\n  console.log(`   - 체크섬 오류: ${checksumInvalidCount}개`);\n  if (invalidBiznoList.length > 0) {\n    console.log('   * 오류 내역:', invalidBiznoList);\n  }\n  console.log(`4. 사업자등록번호 중복 현황: ${duplicates.length}개 번호 중복 (지점/동일법인 등)`);\n  console.log(`5. 현재 사업자등록번호 빈칸: ${blankCount}개 행`);\n  console.log('========================================\\n');\n\n  console.log(`빈칸인 229개 중 처음 15개 샘플:`);\n  console.table(blankRows.slice(0, 15));\n\n  console.log(`\\n빈칸인 229개 중 마지막 10개 샘플:`);\n  console.table(blankRows.slice(-10));\n}\n\naudit().catch(console.error);\n","Description":"Run comprehensive audit of business registration numbers in 크레탑.xlsx","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2/scratch/audit_bizno_core.js","toolAction":"Auditing business numbers in Excel","toolSummary":"Audit business numbers"}}]}
